{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1146116-fir-bholg-s-br","id":1146116,"title":"Fir Bholg's BR","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-02T11:50:57-07:00","id":1146116,"title":"Fir Bholg's BR","content":"It might be just me, but I feel the new edition really did a disservice to the Fir Bholg. Not only did they get to keep both of their Frailties... But now, with Unleashing open to everyone, their Birthright becomes that much less impressive.<br /> <br /> Has any of you come up with house rules to make them not feel so... Broken?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10198-luisarmander","name":"Luisarmander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T13:30:30-07:00","id":1146149,"title":"","content":"Give them some bonus to Unleashing rolls if you want it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T15:49:50-07:00","id":1146178,"title":"","content":"Also I think, that it's just unclear about their Frailties, but I think it should be one or another, depending on where are they (Dreaming or Autumn).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T08:34:16-07:00","id":1146684,"title":"","content":"Yes, the Adhene could use further expansion upon. Hopefully, in a supplement. I miss the Arts that came in their original book, and their particular merits and flaws. While Oneiromancy was redone, I hope at least some form of the original level 5 power, Expiation will return.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firkraag</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1146116-fir-bholg-s-br?p=1146178#post1146178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also I think, that it's just unclear about their Frailties, but I think it should be one or another, depending on where are they (Dreaming or Autumn).</div> </div> </div> </div>On the Fir-bholg specifically, their birth right could use some expanding upon as well. The original version specifically noted that it could be used in the flesh realm with an additional expenditure of Glamour. It's worth noting that the original text for the Sacrifice frailty noted that it specifically affected Glamour gathering &quot;in the Autumn Realm&quot; which means it affects them not at all in the Dreaming.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"fon